          "guid": "msmykvt702erwj4y",
          "message": {
            "text": "The cache bypass is intentionally request-scoped instead of adding another CSS field to fontCacheKey: the missing identity is the run/request itself. Blink supplies the current run’s PrimarySimpleFontDataWithSpace to CTFontCreateForString (fontcachemac.mm:128-150, Chromium 7d859f27), while glyph/meta/shape queries still benefit from the persistent cache.",
            "markdown": "The cache bypass is intentionally request-scoped instead of adding another CSS field to `fontCacheKey`: the missing identity is the run/request itself. Blink supplies the current run’s `PrimarySimpleFontDataWithSpace` to `CTFontCreateForString` (`font_cache_mac.mm:128-150`, Chromium `7d859f27`), while glyph/meta/shape queries still benefit from the persistent cache."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/macos-glyph-extractor/Sources/DomotionGlyphPaths/main.swift"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1342,
                  "endLine": 1357,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    for spec in fontSpecs {\n        guard let ref = spec[\"ref\"] as? String else { continue }\n        let key = fontCacheKey(spec)\n        // Blink passes the current run's PrimarySimpleFontDataWithSpace to\n        // CTFontCreateForString (font_cache_mac.mm:128-150, rev 7d859f27).\n        // CoreText's cascade state must therefore not cross request envelopes.\n        let requestScoped = (spec[\"requestScoped\"] as? NSNumber)?.boolValue == true\n        if !requestScoped, let cached = fontCache[key] {\n            fonts[ref] = cached\n        } else if let entry = try? openFont(spec: spec) {\n            if !requestScoped { fontCache[key] = entry }\n            fonts[ref] = entry\n        }\n        // On open failure the ref is simply absent; queries referencing it\n        // report \"fontRef missing or unknown\" rather than aborting the batch.\n    }"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.95
          },
          "rank": 90,
